<body> 
  <h1>How to Make Ramen</h1> 

  <h2>What You Need</h2> 
  <ul> 
    <li>ramen</li>
    <li>water</li>
    <li>egg</li>
    <li>spice</li>
    <li>and more spice</li>
  </ul> 

  <h2>Steps</h2> 
  <ol> 
    <li>Boil 500ml of water in a pot.</li>
    <li><strong>Be careful when handling the hot water.</strong></li>
    <li>Add the ramen noodles and keep boiling.</li>
    <li>Add spice<em>stir well</em>.</li>
    <li>Add an egg and more spice.</li>
    <li>Serve the ramen while it is hot.</li>
  </ol> 
